  "details": "Ever since the chatbox has come out I've loved it and hated it at the same time. I love that I can just talk to people through the chatbox whenever I dont feel like speaking but a lot of the time because of the ability to only type with one hand at a time I often end up taking too long to type and said group of people are not paying attention to my message or are talking about something else. If the devs could add something like OVR Toolkits' two hand typing it would make things so much easier. Also possibly an autocorrect and or suggestion boxes feature above the keyboard. \nTL;DR\n----------------------\n- Typing takes a long time with the current \"one-handed typing\" especially for use with the chatbox.\n- Implementing \"two-handed typing\" would make it much easier to communicate through the chatbox easier\n- Also an autocorrect and or suggestion boxes feature would be a nice addition but not as important.",
